<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tech Portfolio | Projects</title>
  <style>
    /* Shared Base Styles */
    :root {
      --bg-primary: #0b0f19;
      --bg-surface: #111827;
      --text-main: #f3f4f6;
      --text-muted: #9ca3af;
      --accent-cyan: #06b6d4;
      --accent-blue: #3b82f6;
      --border-color: #1f2937;
      --font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      --max-width: 900px;
      --radius: 8px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-primary);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-family);
      line-height: 1.6;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    header, main, footer {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: var(--max-width);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }

    main { flex: 1; padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; }

    h1, h2, h3 { color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--accent-cyan) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: #ffffff; }
    h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); }

    p { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }

    header {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    }

    nav { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
    nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; }
    nav a { color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s ease; }
    nav a:hover, nav a strong { color: var(--accent-cyan); }
    nav a strong { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-cyan); padding-bottom: 0.25rem; }

    section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

    /* Card Layout for Projects */
    article {
      background-color: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    article:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: var(--accent-blue);
    }

    article p { margin-bottom: 0; }

    footer {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    footer p { margin-bottom: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Tech Innovations Hub</h1>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="projects.html"><strong>Projects</strong></a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">About &amp; Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <h2>Engineering Projects &amp; Lab Builds</h2>
      <p>A structured index tracking development iterations and foundational programming assignments.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Active Deployments</h2>
      
      <article>
        <h3>Semantic Web Architecture</h3>
        <p>Building highly scannable, multi-section documents adhering strictly to correct heading hierarchy and structural standards.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Edge Sensor Integration</h3>
        <p>Configuring microprocessors to parse real-time localized data streams without relying on centralized server clusters.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Tech Trends Hub. All structural layouts reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>